  "details": "Alongside things like Self-only or Others-only grab/locking, having options for Left or Right hand only grabbing/interactions could be very useful.\n\nHaving physbone-based objects in your main-hand or near your main-hand makes it difficult to use with your off-hand when your main-hand is grabbing it all the time.\n\nExample:\n\nUsing a gun that uses Physbones for a slide or magpull, or maybe a container with the ability to pull the lid open with a physbone.\n\nSometimes the Physbone gets grabbed by your main hand, making it difficult to unload the gun, or open the lid, often times without you realizing it.",
